#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "452_Saejima"
msgid "Can you make me a small bomb from this high-grade explosive gunpowder and this battery?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Kamiyama"
msgid "A bomb? You're not particular about the case or cables I use, right?"
msgstr " ¿Una bomba? ¿No eres exigente con el estuche o los cables que uso, ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Kamiyama"
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "Veré que puedo hacer."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "536_Kamiyama"
msgid "I finished! It's not the prettiest thing in the world, but what it lacks in beauty, it makes up for with power."
